# No consumer content in this core

`fynns_ui_design_core` is the design-system source of truth. **Never** import,
mirror, or invent demo copy from any consumer app (GSC Live Preview, agents-hub,
thesis tools, music studio, corrector, …).

## Forbidden in this repo

- Consumer product UI strings (feature names, LLM providers, volume mounts,
  dataset cards, GSC script jargon, app-specific settings titles, …)
- Consumer routes, env keys, API shapes, or screenshots used as “live” demo
  truth inside sandbox / AGENTS / primitive defaults
- Pasting consumer `i18n` / settings cards into Globals “as realism”

## Required instead

- Sandbox Globals / Preview / Layout demos use **generic** placeholders
  (Project preferences, Compact, Digests, Region, sample@example.com, …)
- Default primitive labels stay **English or German** (AGENTS.md Language)
- Consumer-specific chrome lives **only** in the consumer; they copy the
  **structure** from `#form-recipe` / AGENTS recipes and supply their own strings

## Authority

AGENTS.md → Hard rules (**DON'T** paste consumer content) + Language.
If a demo looks like a real consumer screen, rewrite it before shipping.
